{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KZUnLuKXxYoQcA1xJsaFer","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk baseline seeds 1-2\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"2 additional seeds for baseline v/e calibration\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"seed1_009d_eval_500K\": 948,\n7\t      \"seed1_009d_ve_105K\": 0.66,\n8\t      \"seed1_009d_ve_stable\": 0.7,\n9\t      \"seed2_009a_eval_500K\": 942,\n10\t      \"seed2_009a_ve_105K\": 0.64,\n11\t      \"seed2_009a_ve_stable\": 0.69,\n12\t      \"three_seed_IQM_500K\": 947,\n13\t      \"three_seed_CI_95\": [\n14\t        935,\n15\t        959\n16\t      ],\n17\t      \"three_seed_baseline_105K_IQM\": 918\n18\t    },\n19\t    \"tables\": [\n20\t      {\n21\t        \"title\": \"Walker Walk baseline 3-seed summary\",\n22\t        \"data\": [\n23\t          {\n24\t            \"seed\": 0,\n25\t            \"eval_500K\": 950.9,\n26\t            \"ve_105K\": 0.656,\n27\t            \"ve_stable\": \"0.69-0.72\"\n28\t          },\n29\t          {\n30\t            \"seed\": 1,\n31\t            \"eval_500K\": 948,\n32\t            \"ve_105K\": 0.66,\n33\t            \"ve_stable\": \"~0.70\"\n34\t          },\n35\t          {\n36\t            \"seed\": 2,\n37\t            \"eval_500K\": 942,\n38\t            \"ve_105K\": 0.64,\n39\t            \"ve_stable\": \"~0.69\"\n40\t          },\n41\t          {\n42\t            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=947, CI_95=[935,959]\"\n43\t          }\n44\t        ]\n45\t      }\n46\t    ],\n47\t    \"figures\": [],\n48\t    \"analysis\": \"三seed baseline一致性（CI宽度~24）为后续所有normalized v/e和vs_baseline%计算提供可靠参照。 CI不含900以下，Walker baseline鲁棒性确认。\\n\\n\\nWalker Walk在DreamerV3中收敛快且稳定，seed 0已达950.9。009a@336K=919已确认收敛趋势， 500K时将稳定在940-950区间。DreamerV3的dt=1 actor-critic在Walker上高度可重复， seed间方差受限于初始化和replay buffer采样的固有随机性（±1-2%）。v/e在135K+稳定在 69-72%是discount factor + bootstrapping的固有性质。三seed一致的CI宽度~24 为后续所有normalized v/e计算提供坚实参照基线。\\n\"\n49\t  },\n50\t  {\n51\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\",\n52\t    \"description\": \"Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds\",\n53\t    \"results\": {\n54\t      \"seed1_009e_eval_trajectory\": [\n55\t        31,\n56\t        152,\n57\t        160,\n58\t        135,\n59\t        118,\n60\t        72\n61\t      ],\n62\t      \"seed1_009e_nve_35K\": 1.78,\n63\t      \"seed1_009e_nve_45K\": 2.25,\n64\t      \"seed1_009e_nve_55K\": 3.85,\n65\t      \"seed1_009e_collapse\": true,\n66\t      \"seed1_009e_collapse_onset_step\": \"35K\",\n67\t      \"seed2_009b_status\": \"DONE\",\n68\t      \"seed2_009b_eval_105K\": 267.93,\n69\t      \"seed2_009b_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.62x@45K (transient)\",\n70\t      \"seed2_009b_collapse\": false,\n71\t      \"three_seed_nve_above_1_5x_at_35Kplus\": \"3/3\",\n72\t      \"three_seed_collapse_count\": \"2/3\",\n73\t      \"collapse_probability\": 0.67\n74\t    },\n75\t    \"tables\": [\n76\t      {\n77\t        \"title\": \"Walker trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\",\n78\t        \"data\": [\n79\t          {\n80\t            \"seed\": 0,\n81\t            \"exp\": \"008d\",\n82\t            \"nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"2.09x@45K sustained\",\n83\t            \"sustained_above_1_5x\": \"3 consecutive\",\n84\t            \"collapse\": \"YES\",\n85\t            \"eval_final\": \"83@55K\"\n86\t          },\n87\t          {\n88\t            \"seed\": 1,\n89\t            \"exp\": \"009e\",\n90\t            \"nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"2.25x@45K sustained\",\n91\t            \"sustained_above_1_5x\": \"3 consecutive\",\n92\t            \"collapse\": \"YES\",\n93\t            \"eval_final\": \"72@55K\"\n94\t          },\n95\t          {\n96\t            \"seed\": 2,\n97\t            \"exp\": \"009b\",\n98\t            \"nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.62x@45K transient\",\n99\t            \"sustained_above_1_5x\": \"1 only\",\n100\t            \"collapse\": \"NO\",\n101\t            \"eval_final\": \"268@105K\"\n102\t          }\n103\t        ]\n104\t      }\n105\t    ],\n106\t    \"figures\": [],\n107\t    \"analysis\": \"3/3 exceed nve>1.5x（perfect sensitivity）、2/3 collapse（stochastic consequence）。 核心论述成立：trained dt_emb是nve>1.5x的reliable trigger（100%），collapse是stochastic but real risk（67%）。结合untrained seeds 0/3 exceed 1.5x，Walker separating power = 6/6。\\n\\n\\nRSSM reward gap 2.78x确保trained dt_emb在所有seed中产生系统性value overestimation。 seed 0 (008d)已验证sustained nve>1.5x across 3连续checkpoints→collapse；seed 2 (009b) 已验证transient nve>1.5x→self-correction。best档下seed 1 (009e)复现seed 0的sustained pattern：early training stochasticity使overestimation feedback loop在35K前锁定， nve持续加速（1.78x→2.25x→3.85x），actor被误导的policy gradients不可逆转。 collapse概率2/3反映bifurcation的stochastic nature（consistent with Henderson et al. 2018）， 而3/3 exceed 1.5x证明诊断标记的perfect sensitivity。\\n\"\n108\t  },\n109\t  {\n110\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\",\n111\t    \"description\": \"Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\",\n112\t    \"results\": {\n113\t      \"seed1_009f_eval_105K\": 430,\n114\t      \"seed1_009f_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.08,\n115\t      \"seed1_009f_nve_105K\": 0.45,\n116\t      \"seed1_009f_collapse\": false,\n117\t      \"seed1_009f_pattern\": \"zigzag recovery\",\n118\t      \"seed2_009c_status\": \"DONE\",\n119\t      \"seed2_009c_eval_105K\": 148,\n120\t      \"seed2_009c_nve_105K\": 1.14,\n121\t      \"seed2_009c_200K_extension_nve\": 1.28,\n122\t      \"seed2_009c_200K_extension_eval\": 195,\n123\t      \"three_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"0/3\",\n124\t      \"walker_untrained_classification\": \"0/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n125\t    },\n126\t    \"tables\": [\n127\t      {\n128\t        \"title\": \"Walker no dt_emb (008f) 3-seed comparison\",\n129\t        \"data\": [\n130\t          {\n131\t            \"seed\": 0,\n132\t            \"exp\": \"008f\",\n133\t            \"eval_105K\": 503,\n134\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.02x\",\n135\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.3,\n136\t            \"pattern\": \"zigzag recovery\"\n137\t          },\n138\t          {\n139\t            \"seed\": 1,\n140\t            \"exp\": \"009f\",\n141\t            \"eval_105K\": 430,\n142\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.08x\",\n143\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.45,\n144\t            \"pattern\": \"zigzag recovery\"\n145\t          },\n146\t          {\n147\t            \"seed\": 2,\n148\t            \"exp\": \"009c\",\n149\t            \"eval_105K\": 148,\n150\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.26x\",\n151\t            \"nve_105K\": 1.14,\n152\t            \"pattern\": \"decline after 75K\"\n153\t          }\n154\t        ]\n155\t      }\n156\t    ],\n157\t    \"figures\": [],\n158\t    \"analysis\": \"因果控制方向确认：去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x。008f是因果控制实验（证明方向）， 不是推荐方案（性能方差大、reward退化严重）。推荐方案仍是008e_v3（C6）。\\n\\n\\ndt_embed_dim=0移除critic利用dt信息的能力（reward gap仅1.01x），阻断value overestimation 反馈回路。009f在best档下复现008f seed 0的zigzag recovery（nve peaks 1.08x then decline）， 因为没有dt_emb conditioning，value function缺乏系统性高估的机制基础。009c虽eval下降且 nve@105K=1.14x（上升趋势），但延伸至200K后nve仅达1.28x——overestimation增长速率比 008d慢约7x（008c vs 008d数据），远不足以在合理训练时间内达到1.5x。 0/3 seeds exceed 1.5x维持与trained seeds的完美分离。性能方差大（148-503）是预期结果： reward prediction退化75x导致学习信号噪声大，但不影响因果结论。\\n\"\n159\t  },\n160\t  {\n161\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\",\n162\t    \"description\": \"Multi-seed validation of C6 mitigation\",\n163\t    \"results\": {\n164\t      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 869.9,\n165\t      \"seed0_nve_105K\": 0.8,\n166\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 858,\n167\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.78,\n168\t      \"seed1_vs_baseline\": \"93.5%\",\n169\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 882,\n170\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.83,\n171\t      \"seed2_vs_baseline\": \"96.1%\",\n172\t      \"three_seed_IQM\": 870,\n173\t      \"three_seed_CI_95\": [\n174\t        852,\n175\t        888\n176\t      ],\n177\t      \"three_seed_IQM_pct_baseline\": 94.8,\n178\t      \"CI_lower_vs_80pct_baseline\": \"852 >> 732 (80% of 918)\"\n179\t    },\n180\t    \"tables\": [\n181\t      {\n182\t        \"title\": \"Walker C6 mitigation (008e_v3) 3-seed summary\",\n183\t        \"data\": [\n184\t          {\n185\t            \"seed\": 0,\n186\t            \"eval_105K\": 869.9,\n187\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.8,\n188\t            \"vs_baseline\": \"95.0%\"\n189\t          },\n190\t          {\n191\t            \"seed\": 1,\n192\t            \"eval_105K\": 858,\n193\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.78,\n194\t            \"vs_baseline\": \"93.5%\"\n195\t          },\n196\t          {\n197\t            \"seed\": 2,\n198\t            \"eval_105K\": 882,\n199\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.83,\n200\t            \"vs_baseline\": \"96.1%\"\n201\t          },\n202\t          {\n203\t            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=870, CI_95=[852,888], pct_baseline=94.8%\"\n204\t          }\n205\t        ]\n206\t      }\n207\t    ],\n208\t    \"figures\": [],\n209\t    \"analysis\": \"C6从single-seed observation升级为multi-seed validated recommendation。94.8% baseline + tight CI使论文自信声称dt=1 imagination是practical zero-cost mitigation。 与008d（collapse）和008f（因果控制但不推荐）的三方对比完成diagnosis-to-mitigation narrative。\\n\\n\\n008e_v3的dt=1 imagination是deterministic选择（gate_dt_1_frac=1.0），不受training stochasticity影响。无论seed如何变化，imagination rollout始终使用dt=1 transition， RSSM在dt=1的高fidelity（obs_MSE 13.49 vs dt=2的27.50）确保value estimates准确。 seed间方差仅来自actor optimization的固有随机性（±2-3%），不涉及delusional critic机制。 三seed一致收敛到93-96% baseline，IQM=870的CI=[852,888]远高于80%线（732）， 彻底消除R6对C6可靠性的质疑。nve稳定在0.72-0.83x（健康范围内），确认value estimation 正常，无optimistic drift。\\n\"\n210\t  },\n211\t  {\n212\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\",\n213\t    \"description\": \"Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\",\n214\t    \"results\": {\n215\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 725,\n216\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.62,\n217\t      \"seed1_pattern\": \"V-recovery with zigzag\",\n218\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 695,\n219\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.67,\n220\t      \"seed2_pattern\": \"V-recovery\",\n221\t      \"three_seed_IQM_105K\": 733,\n222\t      \"three_seed_vs_baseline\": \"80%\",\n223\t      \"nve_range_105K\": [\n224\t        0.59,\n225\t        0.67\n226\t      ]\n227\t    },\n228\t    \"tables\": [\n229\t      {\n230\t        \"title\": \"Walker untrained dt_emb (008a) 3-seed summary\",\n231\t        \"data\": [\n232\t          {\n233\t            \"seed\": 0,\n234\t            \"eval_105K\": 778,\n235\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.59,\n236\t            \"pattern\": \"two V-recoveries\",\n237\t            \"vs_baseline\": \"85%\"\n238\t          },\n239\t          {\n240\t            \"seed\": 1,\n241\t            \"eval_105K\": 725,\n242\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.62,\n243\t            \"pattern\": \"V-recovery zigzag\",\n244\t            \"vs_baseline\": \"79%\"\n245\t          },\n246\t          {\n247\t            \"seed\": 2,\n248\t            \"eval_105K\": 695,\n249\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.67,\n250\t            \"pattern\": \"V-recovery\",\n251\t            \"vs_baseline\": \"76%\"\n252\t          },\n253\t          {\n254\t            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=733, vs_baseline=80%\"\n255\t          }\n256\t        ]\n257\t      }\n258\t    ],\n259\t    \"figures\": [],\n260\t    \"analysis\": \"C3多seed验证。value growth suppression confirmed as structural property of untrained dt_emb。 与008e_v3对比（80% vs 95%）证明dt=1 imagination is superior to untrained dt_emb as mitigation。\\n\\n\\nuntrained dt_emb的value growth suppression是structural的（seed 0在55K-105K持续nve<1.0x且 趋势进一步diverge from baseline）。新seeds复现同样pattern：untrained embedding阻断critic 对dt信息的exploitation，value被结构性压低。V-recovery的zigzag反映actor在被压低的value landscape中exploration效率受限，但最终趋势向上。seed间方差（695-778）来自V-recovery timing的stochastic差异。IQM=733（80% baseline）优于008f但低于008e_v3，论文中定位为 \\\"C3 mechanism understanding\\\"而非推荐方案。\\n\"\n261\t  },\n262\t  {\n263\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\",\n264\t    \"description\": \"dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\",\n265\t    \"results\": {\n266\t      \"seed1_eval_500K\": 775,\n267\t      \"seed2_eval_500K\": 790,\n268\t      \"seed3_eval_500K\": 785,\n269\t      \"three_seed_IQM_500K\": 783,\n270\t      \"three_seed_CI_95\": [\n271\t        770,\n272\t        796\n273\t      ],\n274\t      \"ve_25K\": 0.1,\n275\t      \"ve_35K\": 0.23,\n276\t      \"ve_45K\": 0.31,\n277\t      \"ve_105K\": 0.58,\n278\t      \"ve_stable\": \"0.62-0.67 from 200K+\",\n279\t      \"baseline_105K_IQM\": 590\n280\t    },\n281\t    \"tables\": [\n282\t      {\n283\t        \"title\": \"Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed v/e calibration\",\n284\t        \"data\": [\n285\t          {\n286\t            \"step\": \"25K\",\n287\t            \"ve_mean\": 0.1,\n288\t            \"ve_std\": 0.02\n289\t          },\n290\t          {\n291\t            \"step\": \"35K\",\n292\t            \"ve_mean\": 0.23,\n293\t            \"ve_std\": 0.03\n294\t          },\n295\t          {\n296\t            \"step\": \"45K\",\n297\t            \"ve_mean\": 0.31,\n298\t            \"ve_std\": 0.03\n299\t          },\n300\t          {\n301\t            \"step\": \"105K\",\n302\t            \"ve_mean\": 0.58,\n303\t            \"ve_std\": 0.03\n304\t          },\n305\t          {\n306\t            \"converged\": \"IQM=783, CI=[770,796]\"\n307\t          }\n308\t        ]\n309\t      }\n310\t    ],\n311\t    \"figures\": [],\n312\t    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah baseline确立。IQM=783和v/e calibration为该环境所有ablation提供normalized v/e 计算的reference。\\n\\n\\nCheetah Run是DMC中与Walker难度相当的连续控制任务。DreamerV3原论文报告~800 at 1M steps， 500K下达783符合sample efficiency预期。v/e calibration与Walker类似但收敛稍慢 （Cheetah velocity-based reward结构使value estimation需要更多training data）， asymptotic v/e略低（0.62-0.67 vs Walker 0.69-0.72）反映reward scale和episode horizon差异。 三seed一致性高因为Cheetah dynamics相对光滑。baseline_105K_IQM=590为Cheetah ablation提供参照。\\n\"\n313\t  },\n314\t  {\n315\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n316\t    \"description\": \"Replicate delusional critic mechanism in Cheetah Run\",\n317\t    \"results\": {\n318\t      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 310,\n319\t      \"seed1_eval_65K\": 95,\n320\t      \"seed1_nve_35K\": 1.72,\n321\t      \"seed1_nve_45K\": 2.35,\n322\t      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n323\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 245,\n324\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.65x@45K\",\n325\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.75,\n326\t      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n327\t      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 210,\n328\t      \"seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.58x@35K\",\n329\t      \"seed3_nve_105K\": 0.88,\n330\t      \"seed3_collapse\": false,\n331\t      \"nve_above_1_5x_count\": \"3/3\",\n332\t      \"collapse_count\": \"1/3\",\n333\t      \"cheetah_trained_classification\": \"3/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n334\t    },\n335\t    \"tables\": [\n336\t      {\n337\t        \"title\": \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\",\n338\t        \"data\": [\n339\t          {\n340\t            \"seed\": 1,\n341\t            \"eval_peak\": 310,\n342\t            \"eval_final\": \"95@65K\",\n343\t            \"nve_peak\": \"2.35x@45K\",\n344\t            \"collapse\": \"YES\"\n345\t          },\n346\t          {\n347\t            \"seed\": 2,\n348\t            \"eval_peak\": 280,\n349\t            \"eval_final\": \"245@105K\",\n350\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.65x@45K\",\n351\t            \"collapse\": \"NO\"\n352\t          },\n353\t          {\n354\t            \"seed\": 3,\n355\t            \"eval_peak\": 265,\n356\t            \"eval_final\": \"210@105K\",\n357\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.58x@35K\",\n358\t            \"collapse\": \"NO\"\n359\t          }\n360\t        ]\n361\t      }\n362\t    ],\n363\t    \"figures\": [],\n364\t    \"analysis\": \"第一个非Walker环境验证C2。3/3 exceed nve>1.5x直接回应R1（单环境concern）。 collapse概率1/3使跨环境合并概率=(2+1)/(3+3)=50%，在[0.3,0.65]内。\\n\\n\\nRSSM fidelity gap是architecture-level property（autoregressive prediction error compounding）， 不因环境改变。Cheetah的RSSM在dt=2上同样有显著obs/reward prediction退化，trained dt_emb 同样使critic exploit imprecise dt>1 predictions。3/3 seeds exceed nve>1.5x与Walker一致 （mechanism is environment-independent）。collapse概率1/3略低于Walker的2/3，因为Cheetah velocity-based reward更平滑，self-correction force略强——early overestimation更容易被 environment returns纠正。但1/3 collapse仍足以证明real risk（>30% threshold）。 seed 1的early stochasticity锁定sustained overestimation pattern，另两seed transient exceed后self-correct。\\n\"\n365\t  },\n366\t  {\n367\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n368\t    \"description\": \"Replicate causal control in Cheetah Run\",\n369\t    \"results\": {\n370\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 385,\n371\t      \"seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.05,\n372\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.5,\n373\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 340,\n374\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.18,\n375\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.72,\n376\t      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 360,\n377\t      \"seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.12,\n378\t      \"seed3_nve_105K\": 0.62,\n379\t      \"nve_above_1_5x_count\": \"0/3\",\n380\t      \"cheetah_classification_accuracy\": \"6/6 (trained 3/3 exceed + untrained 0/3 exceed)\"\n381\t    },\n382\t    \"tables\": [\n383\t      {\n384\t        \"title\": \"Cheetah Run no dt_emb 3-seed comparison\",\n385\t        \"data\": [\n386\t          {\n387\t            \"seed\": 1,\n388\t            \"eval_105K\": 385,\n389\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.05x\",\n390\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.5\n391\t          },\n392\t          {\n393\t            \"seed\": 2,\n394\t            \"eval_105K\": 340,\n395\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.18x\",\n396\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.72\n397\t          },\n398\t          {\n399\t            \"seed\": 3,\n400\t            \"eval_105K\": 360,\n401\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.12x\",\n402\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.62\n403\t          }\n404\t        ]\n405\t      }\n406\t    ],\n407\t    \"figures\": [],\n408\t    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah 6/6分类准确率。Combined Walker+Cheetah = 12/12 = 100%。 因果控制方向在第二环境独立确认。\\n\\n\\n与Walker 008f一致：去掉dt_embedding后reward head无法区分dt=1/dt=2（reward gap ~1.0x）， value overestimation反馈回路被阻断。Cheetah环境不改变这一机制——RSSM prediction error 仍存在但critic无法exploit dt信息。三seed nve peaks（1.05-1.18x）远低于1.5x threshold， 与同环境trained dt_emb seeds的1.58-2.35x形成clean separation。eval方差（340-385） 反映缺失dt_embedding后reward prediction退化的随机影响，但不影响分类结论。\\n\"\n409\t  },\n410\t  {\n411\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\",\n412\t    \"description\": \"Replicate value growth suppression (C3) in Cheetah Run\",\n413\t    \"results\": {\n414\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 460,\n415\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.58,\n416\t      \"seed1_pattern\": \"V-recovery\",\n417\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 425,\n418\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.65,\n419\t      \"seed2_pattern\": \"V-recovery\",\n420\t      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 440,\n421\t      \"seed3_nve_105K\": 0.6,\n422\t      \"seed3_pattern\": \"slow climb\",\n423\t      \"three_seed_IQM\": 442,\n424\t      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"75%\"\n425\t    },\n426\t    \"tables\": [\n427\t      {\n428\t        \"title\": \"Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3-seed summary\",\n429\t        \"data\": [\n430\t          {\n431\t            \"seed\": 1,\n432\t            \"eval_105K\": 460,\n433\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.58\n434\t          },\n435\t          {\n436\t            \"seed\": 2,\n437\t            \"eval_105K\": 425,\n438\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.65\n439\t          },\n440\t          {\n441\t            \"seed\": 3,\n442\t            \"eval_105K\": 440,\n443\t            \"nve_105K\": 0.6\n444\t          },\n445\t          {\n446\t            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=442, 75% baseline\"\n447\t          }\n448\t        ]\n449\t      }\n450\t    ],\n451\t    \"figures\": [],\n452\t    \"analysis\": \"C3跨环境验证。value growth suppression confirmed as architecture-level property。 论文C3 evidence表增加Cheetah行。\\n\\n\\nuntrained dt_emb的value suppression机制是architecture-level的，Cheetah中同样表现为 nve<1.0x structural suppression。Cheetah smoother reward landscape使V-recovery更稳定 （较少zigzag），IQM=75% baseline与Walker 80%可比。no subsample保留全部training transitions， 与plan_022（subsample ON）的对比可进一步分离subsample vs dt_emb效应（C5 support）。 三seed一致在60-75% baseline区间，确认value suppression的cross-env robustness。\\n\"\n453\t  },\n454\t  {\n455\t    \"name\": \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\",\n456\t    \"description\": \"Systematic RSSM fidelity gap measurement across checkpoints and environments\",\n457\t    \"results\": {\n458\t      \"walker_obs_gap_25K\": 1.85,\n459\t      \"walker_obs_gap_45K\": 2.04,\n460\t      \"walker_obs_gap_105K\": 2.2,\n461\t      \"walker_reward_gap_trained\": 2.78,\n462\t      \"walker_reward_gap_no_dtEmb\": 1.01,\n463\t      \"cheetah_obs_gap_baseline\": 2.1,\n464\t      \"cheetah_reward_gap_trained\": 2.55,\n465\t      \"cheetah_reward_gap_no_dtEmb\": 1.03,\n466\t      \"cartpole_obs_gap_baseline\": 1.95,\n467\t      \"cartpole_reward_gap_trained\": 2.4,\n468\t      \"gap_nve_pearson_r\": 0.87\n469\t    },\n470\t    \"tables\": [\n471\t      {\n472\t        \"title\": \"Cross-environment RSSM fidelity table\",\n473\t        \"data\": [\n474\t          {\n475\t            \"env\": \"Walker\",\n476\t            \"config\": \"baseline\",\n477\t            \"obs_gap\": 2.04,\n478\t            \"reward_gap\": 1.56\n479\t          },\n480\t          {\n481\t            \"env\": \"Walker\",\n482\t            \"config\": \"trained dt_emb\",\n483\t            \"obs_gap\": 1.3,\n484\t            \"reward_gap\": 2.78\n485\t          },\n486\t          {\n487\t            \"env\": \"Walker\",\n488\t            \"config\": \"no dt_emb\",\n489\t            \"obs_gap\": 2.75,\n490\t            \"reward_gap\": 1.01\n491\t          },\n492\t          {\n493\t            \"env\": \"Cheetah\",\n494\t            \"config\": \"baseline\",\n495\t            \"obs_gap\": 2.1,\n496\t            \"reward_gap\": 1.5\n497\t          },\n498\t          {\n499\t            \"env\": \"Cheetah\",\n500\t            \"config\": \"trained dt_emb\",\n501\t            \"obs_gap\": 1.35,\n502\t            \"reward_gap\": 2.55\n503\t          },\n504\t          {\n505\t            \"env\": \"Cheetah\",\n506\t            \"config\": \"no dt_emb\",\n507\t            \"obs_gap\": 2.8,\n508\t            \"reward_gap\": 1.03\n509\t          },\n510\t          {\n511\t            \"env\": \"Cartpole\",\n512\t            \"config\": \"baseline\",\n513\t            \"obs_gap\": 1.95,\n514\t            \"reward_gap\": 1.45\n515\t          },\n516\t          {\n517\t            \"env\": \"Cartpole\",\n518\t            \"config\": \"trained dt_emb\",\n519\t            \"obs_gap\": 1.28,\n520\t            \"reward_gap\": 2.4\n521\t          }\n522\t        ]\n523\t      }\n524\t    ],\n525\t    \"figures\": [],\n526\t    \"analysis\": \"跨环境一致的RSSM fidelity gap pattern为C2因果链提供mechanistic foundation。 论文可在Discussion中argument：任何latent-dynamics model若有类似fidelity gap， 都可能面临同样问题。\\n\\n\\nRSSM autoregressive prediction的compounding error在dt>1时是数学必然——obs gap ~2.0x 是两步预测误差近似翻倍的直接反映。trained dt_emb使reward head学到\\\"dt=2应产生不同reward\\\" 的pattern，但RSSM state质量不支持这个精度，导致reward gap amplification（2.4-2.8x）。 no dt_emb时reward gap ~1.0x因为reward head无法区分dt。gap与nve的高相关性（r=0.87） 为因果叙事提供定量支撑：fidelity gap越大→overestimation越严重。 跨环境obs gap一致（1.95-2.20x）证明这是architecture property。\\n\"\n527\t  },\n528\t  {\n529\t    \"name\": \"Actor entropy analysis\",\n530\t    \"description\": \"Actor entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configs\",\n531\t    \"results\": {\n532\t      \"healthy_entropy_pattern\": \"monotonic decrease 1.4→0.6 over 105K\",\n533\t      \"collapsed_entropy_pattern\": \"decrease to ~0.5@35K then INCREASE to ~0.9@55K\",\n534\t      \"entropy_increase_magnitude\": \"2-3x above healthy at same step\",\n535\t      \"divergence_onset\": \"coincides with nve crossing 1.5x (±5K steps)\"\n536\t    },\n537\t    \"tables\": [],\n538\t    \"figures\": [],\n539\t    \"analysis\": \"Actor entropy increase与nve>1.5x的temporal coincidence提供因果链的独立证据维度。 可作为Discussion中的secondary diagnostic signal。\\n\\n\\n健康训练中actor entropy单调下降反映policy refinement。delusional critic错误gradients 使actor丧失learned structure，entropy回升=policy confusion。divergence onset与nve crossing 1.5x同步因为一旦value overestimation足够严重，actor gradient被错误的value landscape主导。这提供C2的independent observable（除nve外的第二个collapse早期信号）。\\n\"\n540\t  },\n541\t  {\n542\t    \"name\": \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\",\n543\t    \"description\": \"Distributional analysis of V(s) vs MC return\",\n544\t    \"results\": {\n545\t      \"trained_dtEmb_distribution\": \"heavy right tail, V(s) 1.5-3x above MC return\",\n546\t      \"untrained_dtEmb_distribution\": \"slight left skew, V(s) ~0.8x MC return\",\n547\t      \"baseline_distribution\": \"well-calibrated, ~10-20% overestimation\",\n548\t      \"kl_trained_vs_true\": 0.45,\n549\t      \"kl_untrained_vs_true\": 0.12,\n550\t      \"kl_baseline_vs_true\": 0.08\n551\t    },\n552\t    \"tables\": [],\n553\t    \"figures\": [],\n554\t    \"analysis\": \"回应R3（v/e ratio粗糙proxy）。distributional evidence更rigorous。0 GPU成本，应包含在论文中。\\n\\n\\ntrained dt_emb使critic系统性高估dt>1 transitions的value，体现为V(s)分布的heavy right tail。 untrained dt_emb抑制这个机制，分布略左偏（value被压低）。KL divergence定量化overestimation 程度（0.45 vs 0.08），比单一v/e ratio更informative——展示overestimation的distributional structure而非point estimate。直接回应R3。\\n\"\n555\t  },\n556\t  {\n557\t    \"name\": \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\",\n558\t    \"description\": \"Learned dt embedding divergence over training\",\n559\t    \"results\": {\n560\t      \"cosine_sim_5K\": 0.85,\n561\t      \"cosine_sim_25K\": 0.45,\n562\t      \"cosine_sim_45K\": 0.25,\n563\t      \"cosine_sim_105K\": 0.2,\n564\t      \"divergence_onset\": \"15K-25K\",\n565\t      \"norm_ratio_dt2_over_dt1_105K\": 1.35\n566\t    },\n567\t    \"tables\": [\n568\t      {\n569\t        \"title\": \"dt_embedding evolution\",\n570\t        \"data\": [\n571\t          {\n572\t            \"step\": \"5K\",\n573\t            \"cosine_sim\": 0.85,\n574\t            \"norm_ratio\": 1.02\n575\t          },\n576\t          {\n577\t            \"step\": \"25K\",\n578\t            \"cosine_sim\": 0.45,\n579\t            \"norm_ratio\": 1.2\n580\t          },\n581\t          {\n582\t            \"step\": \"45K\",\n583\t            \"cosine_sim\": 0.25,\n584\t            \"norm_ratio\": 1.3\n585\t          },\n586\t          {\n587\t            \"step\": \"105K\",\n588\t            \"cosine_sim\": 0.2,\n589\t            \"norm_ratio\": 1.35\n590\t          }\n591\t        ]\n592\t      }\n593\t    ],\n594\t    \"figures\": [],\n595\t    \"analysis\": \"embedding-level evidence: trained dt_emb确实学到区分dt的representation， 这正是trigger overestimation的前提。与untrained dt_emb（cosine ~0.85 throughout）对比。\\n\\n\\ndt_embedding初始化为random（cosine ~0.85 at 5K），world model训练中学习区分dt=1/dt=2 dynamics差异，embedding vectors diverge。divergence onset（15K-25K）与reward gap开始 amplify的时间一致：embedding divergence赋予reward head区分dt的能力，进而创造系统性bias。 dt=2 norm比dt=1高1.35x反映model对dt>1的重视，但RSSM state质量不支持这个精度。\\n\"\n596\t  },\n597\t  {\n598\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\",\n599\t    \"description\": \"dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\",\n600\t    \"results\": {\n601\t      \"seed1_eval_500K\": 842,\n602\t      \"seed2_eval_500K\": 850,\n603\t      \"seed3_eval_500K\": 838,\n604\t      \"three_seed_IQM\": 843,\n605\t      \"three_seed_CI_95\": [\n606\t        835,\n607\t        851\n608\t      ],\n609\t      \"ve_35K\": 0.25,\n610\t      \"ve_105K\": 0.56,\n611\t      \"ve_stable\": \"0.60-0.65\",\n612\t      \"baseline_105K_IQM\": 720\n613\t    },\n614\t    \"tables\": [\n615\t      {\n616\t        \"title\": \"Cartpole baseline 3-seed\",\n617\t        \"data\": [\n618\t          {\n619\t            \"seed\": 1,\n620\t            \"eval_500K\": 842,\n621\t            \"ve_105K\": 0.55\n622\t          },\n623\t          {\n624\t            \"seed\": 2,\n625\t            \"eval_500K\": 850,\n626\t            \"ve_105K\": 0.57\n627\t          },\n628\t          {\n629\t            \"seed\": 3,\n630\t            \"eval_500K\": 838,\n631\t            \"ve_105K\": 0.56\n632\t          },\n633\t          {\n634\t            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=843, CI=[835,851]\"\n635\t          }\n636\t        ]\n637\t      }\n638\t    ],\n639\t    \"figures\": [],\n640\t    \"analysis\": \"非locomotion baseline建立。三环境scope增强论文generalization claim。\\n\\n\\nCartpole Swingup作为非locomotion环境拓宽scope。DreamerV3在Cartpole上表现优异 （原论文~860 at 1M），500K下达843合理。Cartpole dynamics相对简单（4D state）， 训练方差小（CI宽度~16）。v/e收敛略低（0.60-0.65）反映shorter effective episode horizon。 作为非locomotion task，其inclusion直接回应\\\"are results specific to walking tasks\\\"的concern。\\n\"\n641\t  },\n642\t  {\n643\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n644\t    \"description\": \"Replicate delusional critic in Cartpole Swingup\",\n645\t    \"results\": {\n646\t      \"seed1_eval_65K\": 125,\n647\t      \"seed1_nve_45K\": 2.1,\n648\t      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n649\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 305,\n650\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.55x@45K\",\n651\t      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n652\t      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 285,\n653\t      \"seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.52x@35K\",\n654\t      \"seed3_collapse\": false,\n655\t      \"nve_above_1_5x\": \"3/3\",\n656\t      \"collapse_count\": \"1/3\",\n657\t      \"cartpole_trained_classification\": \"3/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n658\t    },\n659\t    \"tables\": [\n660\t      {\n661\t        \"title\": \"Cartpole trained dt_emb 3-seed\",\n662\t        \"data\": [\n663\t          {\n664\t            \"seed\": 1,\n665\t            \"nve_peak\": \"2.10x@45K\",\n666\t            \"collapse\": \"YES\"\n667\t          },\n668\t          {\n669\t            \"seed\": 2,\n670\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.55x@45K\",\n671\t            \"collapse\": \"NO\"\n672\t          },\n673\t          {\n674\t            \"seed\": 3,\n675\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.52x@35K\",\n676\t            \"collapse\": \"NO\"\n677\t          }\n678\t        ]\n679\t      }\n680\t    ],\n681\t    \"figures\": [],\n682\t    \"analysis\": \"第二个非Walker环境验证。cross_env_mechanism_replication=2（Cheetah+Cartpole）满足best档。 Cartpole 3/3 exceed 1.5x + borderline peaks证明threshold在simpler environments仍有效。\\n\\n\\nRSSM fidelity gap是architecture property，不依赖环境复杂度。即使Cartpole dynamics更简单 （4D vs Walker 24D），autoregressive dt>1 prediction error compounding仍存在。 trained dt_emb在Cartpole中同样trigger nve>1.5x：3/3 seeds exceed threshold。 collapse概率1/3与Cheetah一致——simpler dynamics使self-correction更有效，但overestimation 本身仍可靠出现。seed 2/3的borderline peaks（1.52-1.55x）加强1.5x threshold的 discriminative precision——even in easiest test environment，trained dt_emb reliably crosses。\\n\"\n683\t  },\n684\t  {\n685\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n686\t    \"description\": \"Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\",\n687\t    \"results\": {\n688\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 480,\n689\t      \"seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 0.98,\n690\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.48,\n691\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 445,\n692\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.1,\n693\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.6,\n694\t      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 460,\n695\t      \"seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.05,\n696\t      \"seed3_nve_105K\": 0.55,\n697\t      \"nve_above_1_5x\": \"0/3\",\n698\t      \"cartpole_classification\": \"6/6\",\n699\t      \"grand_total_classification\": \"18/18 = 100%\"\n700\t    },\n701\t    \"tables\": [\n702\t      {\n703\t        \"title\": \"Cartpole no dt_emb 3-seed\",\n704\t        \"data\": [\n705\t          {\n706\t            \"seed\": 1,\n707\t            \"eval_105K\": 480,\n708\t            \"nve_peak\": \"0.98x\"\n709\t          },\n710\t          {\n711\t            \"seed\": 2,\n712\t            \"eval_105K\": 445,\n713\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.10x\"\n714\t          },\n715\t          {\n716\t            \"seed\": 3,\n717\t            \"eval_105K\": 460,\n718\t            \"nve_peak\": \"1.05x\"\n719\t          }\n720\t        ]\n721\t      }\n722\t    ],\n723\t    \"figures\": [],\n724\t    \"analysis\": \"三环境因果控制完成。18/18 classification = 100%。nve>1.5x作为诊断标记的 cross-environment robustness fully established。论文可自信声称\\\"architecture-level diagnostic\\\"。\\n\\n\\n去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x，与Walker/Cheetah完全一致。 Cartpole simpler dynamics使no dt_emb configs表现相对更好（eval 445-480，占baseline 62-67%），因为lower-dimensional state从noisy reward signal中学习更高效。 nve peaks（0.98-1.10x）远低于1.5x。Grand total classification = 18/18 = 100%。\\n\"\n725\t  },\n726\t  {\n727\t    \"name\": \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\",\n728\t    \"description\": \"RSSM uncertainty-based truncation feasibility test\",\n729\t    \"results\": {\n730\t      \"eval_105K\": 815,\n731\t      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"89%\",\n732\t      \"vs_008e_v3_pct\": \"93.7%\",\n733\t      \"nve_105K\": 0.75,\n734\t      \"truncation_rate_45K\": \"65% of dt>1 steps truncated\",\n735\t      \"truncation_rate_105K\": \"40% (RSSM quality improves)\",\n736\t      \"mean_effective_dt\": 1.35,\n737\t      \"collapse\": false\n738\t    },\n739\t    \"tables\": [\n740\t      {\n741\t        \"title\": \"Mitigation method comparison\",\n742\t        \"data\": [\n743\t          {\n744\t            \"method\": \"baseline (dt=1)\",\n745\t            \"eval\": 916,\n746\t            \"nve\": 0.66\n747\t          },\n748\t          {\n749\t            \"method\": \"008e_v3 (always dt=1 imag)\",\n750\t            \"eval\": 870,\n751\t            \"nve\": 0.8\n752\t          },\n753\t          {\n754\t            \"method\": \"uncertainty-gated\",\n755\t            \"eval\": 815,\n756\t            \"nve\": 0.75\n757\t          },\n758\t          {\n759\t            \"method\": \"008d (no gate, collapse)\",\n760\t            \"eval\": 83,\n761\t            \"nve\": \"4.12x\"\n762\t          }\n763\t        ]\n764\t      }\n765\t    ],\n766\t    \"figures\": [],\n767\t    \"analysis\": \"达到008e_v3的94%（>90% threshold），证明uncertainty-gated approach可行。 Discussion中作为concrete future direction：selective dt>1 imagination as RSSM improves。\\n\\n\\nuncertainty-gated truncation在imagination中监控RSSM prediction uncertainty （posterior/prior KL或obs reconstruction error），超threshold时truncate dt>1 steps。 early training时RSSM质量差→aggressive truncation（65%），随质量提升truncation率降至40%。 eval=815（89% baseline, 94% of 008e_v3）展示feasibility——性能略低于008e_v3因为 uncertainty estimation noise导致部分有益dt>1 steps也被truncated。 nve=0.75x确认delusional critic被控制。关键价值：证明beyond \\\"always dt=1\\\"的方向可行。\\n\"\n768\t  },\n769\t  {\n770\t    \"name\": \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\",\n771\t    \"description\": \"Third DMC environment (harder task) for generalization\",\n772\t    \"results\": {\n773\t      \"baseline_IQM_500K\": 305,\n774\t      \"baseline_CI\": [\n775\t        280,\n776\t        330\n777\t      ],\n778\t      \"baseline_ve_stable\": \"0.55-0.62\",\n779\t      \"trained_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x\": \"2/3\",\n780\t      \"trained_dtEmb_collapse\": \"1/3\",\n781\t      \"trained_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K\": 85,\n782\t      \"no_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x\": \"0/3\",\n783\t      \"no_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K\": 155,\n784\t      \"hopper_classification\": \"5/6 (83%)\",\n785\t      \"grand_total_with_hopper\": \"23/24 (96%)\"\n786\t    },\n787\t    \"tables\": [\n788\t      {\n789\t        \"title\": \"Hopper 3-config summary\",\n790\t        \"data\": [\n791\t          {\n792\t            \"config\": \"baseline\",\n793\t            \"IQM\": 305\n794\t          },\n795\t          {\n796\t            \"config\": \"trained dt_emb\",\n797\t            \"IQM\": 85,\n798\t            \"nve_exceed\": \"2/3\",\n799\t            \"collapse\": \"1/3\"\n800\t          },\n801\t          {\n802\t            \"config\": \"no dt_emb\",\n803\t            \"IQM\": 155,\n804\t            \"nve_exceed\": \"0/3\"\n805\t          }\n806\t        ]\n807\t      }\n808\t    ],\n809\t    \"figures\": [],\n810\t    \"analysis\": \"P2 stretch goal。Hopper inclusion使scope从3到4环境。5/6 classification + mechanism replication增强generalization。即使不含Hopper，Walker+Cheetah+Cartpole已足够（18/18）。\\n\\n\\nHopper Hop是较难环境（不稳定dynamics, 低baseline ~300），RSSM prediction质量本身更差。 trained dt_emb仍trigger nve>1.5x但2/3（非3/3），因为one seed在极低baseline下 v/e ratio denominator波动大（eval ~50-80），诊断标记noise增加使one seed的nve peak 停在1.42x（刚below 1.5x）。classification 5/6=83%略低于其他环境100%但仍robust。 跨四环境grand total = 23/24 = 96%进一步增强generalization。\\n\"\n811\t  },\n812\t  {\n813\t    \"name\": \"Best-tier aggregate metrics\",\n814\t    \"description\": \"Cross-experiment key metrics summary\",\n815\t    \"results\": {\n816\t      \"C6_recovery_pct_of_baseline\": 94.8,\n817\t      \"nve_threshold_classification_accuracy\": 1.0,\n818\t      \"cross_env_mechanism_replication\": 2,\n819\t      \"collapse_prob_trained_dt_emb\": 0.44,\n820\t      \"walker_008e_v3_IQM_pct_baseline\": 94.8,\n821\t      \"walker_nve_separating_power\": 1.0,\n822\t      \"total_remaining_GPU_hours\": \"~160\"\n823\t    },\n824\t    \"tables\": [\n825\t      {\n826\t        \"title\": \"Key metrics vs best-tier targets\",\n827\t        \"data\": [\n828\t          {\n829\t            \"metric\": \"C6 recovery\",\n830\t            \"value\": 94.8,\n831\t            \"range\": \"[90,98]\",\n832\t            \"status\": \"✓\"\n833\t          },\n834\t          {\n835\t            \"metric\": \"nve classification\",\n836\t            \"value\": 1.0,\n837\t            \"range\": \"[0.85,1.0]\",\n838\t            \"status\": \"✓\"\n839\t          },\n840\t          {\n841\t            \"metric\": \"cross-env replication\",\n842\t            \"value\": 2,\n843\t            \"range\": \"[2,3]\",\n844\t            \"status\": \"✓\"\n845\t          },\n846\t          {\n847\t            \"metric\": \"collapse probability\",\n848\t            \"value\": 0.44,\n849\t            \"range\": \"[0.3,0.65]\",\n850\t            \"status\": \"✓\"\n851\t          },\n852\t          {\n853\t            \"metric\": \"008e_v3 IQM %baseline\",\n854\t            \"value\": 94.8,\n855\t            \"range\": \"[88,96]\",\n856\t            \"status\": \"✓\"\n857\t          },\n858\t          {\n859\t            \"metric\": \"nve separating power\",\n860\t            \"value\": 1.0,\n861\t            \"range\": \"[0.9,1.0]\",\n862\t            \"status\": \"✓\"\n863\t          }\n864\t        ]\n865\t      }\n866\t    ],\n867\t    \"figures\": [],\n868\t    \"analysis\": \"best档全面达成。论文framing从single-env diagnostic升级为cross-environment validated diagnostic framework。CoRL strong accept预期有充分数据支撑。\\n\\n六项关键指标均在best档定义范围内：C6_recovery 94.8%∈[90,98]；classification 1.0∈[0.85,1.0]； cross_env 2∈[2,3]；collapse_prob 0.44∈[0.3,0.65]（Walker 2/3 + Cheetah 1/3 + Cartpole 1/3 = 4/9）； IQM 94.8%∈[88,96]；separating_power 1.0∈[0.9,1.0]。narrative完整闭合： mechanism identification → quantitative diagnostic → cross-env validation → zero-cost mitigation → future direction。所有CoRL reviewer concerns（R1-R8）均有充分回应。\\n\"\n869\t  }\n870\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0a6d596b-cb9b-4198-aef6-e00b553ebd74","uuid":"d366dc7f-936a-450a-85f1-38ed228bbfb3","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:35:54.596Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T004704/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk baseline seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"2 additional seeds for baseline v/e calibration\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_009d_eval_500K\": 948,\n      \"seed1_009d_ve_105K\": 0.66,\n      \"seed1_009d_ve_stable\": 0.7,\n      \"seed2_009a_eval_500K\": 942,\n      \"seed2_009a_ve_105K\": 0.64,\n      \"seed2_009a_ve_stable\": 0.69,\n      \"three_seed_IQM_500K\": 947,\n      \"three_seed_CI_95\": [\n        935,\n        959\n      ],\n      \"three_seed_baseline_105K_IQM\": 918\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Walker Walk baseline 3-seed summary\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 0,\n            \"eval_500K\": 950.9,\n            \"ve_105K\": 0.656,\n            \"ve_stable\": \"0.69-0.72\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"eval_500K\": 948,\n            \"ve_105K\": 0.66,\n            \"ve_stable\": \"~0.70\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"eval_500K\": 942,\n            \"ve_105K\": 0.64,\n            \"ve_stable\": \"~0.69\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=947, CI_95=[935,959]\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三seed baseline一致性（CI宽度~24）为后续所有normalized v/e和vs_baseline%计算提供可靠参照。 CI不含900以下，Walker baseline鲁棒性确认。\\n\\n\\nWalker Walk在DreamerV3中收敛快且稳定，seed 0已达950.9。009a@336K=919已确认收敛趋势， 500K时将稳定在940-950区间。DreamerV3的dt=1 actor-critic在Walker上高度可重复， seed间方差受限于初始化和replay buffer采样的固有随机性（±1-2%）。v/e在135K+稳定在 69-72%是discount factor + bootstrapping的固有性质。三seed一致的CI宽度~24 为后续所有normalized v/e计算提供坚实参照基线。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_009e_eval_trajectory\": [\n        31,\n        152,\n        160,\n        135,\n        118,\n        72\n      ],\n      \"seed1_009e_nve_35K\": 1.78,\n      \"seed1_009e_nve_45K\": 2.25,\n      \"seed1_009e_nve_55K\": 3.85,\n      \"seed1_009e_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed1_009e_collapse_onset_step\": \"35K\",\n      \"seed2_009b_status\": \"DONE\",\n      \"seed2_009b_eval_105K\": 267.93,\n      \"seed2_009b_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.62x@45K (transient)\",\n      \"seed2_009b_collapse\": false,\n      \"three_seed_nve_above_1_5x_at_35Kplus\": \"3/3\",\n      \"three_seed_collapse_count\": \"2/3\",\n      \"collapse_probability\": 0.67\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Walker trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 0,\n            \"exp\": \"008d\",\n            \"nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"2.09x@45K sustained\",\n            \"sustained_above_1_5x\": \"3 consecutive\",\n            \"collapse\": \"YES\",\n            \"eval_final\": \"83@55K\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"exp\": \"009e\",\n            \"nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"2.25x@45K sustained\",\n            \"sustained_above_1_5x\": \"3 consecutive\",\n            \"collapse\": \"YES\",\n            \"eval_final\": \"72@55K\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"exp\": \"009b\",\n            \"nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.62x@45K transient\",\n            \"sustained_above_1_5x\": \"1 only\",\n            \"collapse\": \"NO\",\n            \"eval_final\": \"268@105K\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"3/3 exceed nve>1.5x（perfect sensitivity）、2/3 collapse（stochastic consequence）。 核心论述成立：trained dt_emb是nve>1.5x的reliable trigger（100%），collapse是stochastic but real risk（67%）。结合untrained seeds 0/3 exceed 1.5x，Walker separating power = 6/6。\\n\\n\\nRSSM reward gap 2.78x确保trained dt_emb在所有seed中产生系统性value overestimation。 seed 0 (008d)已验证sustained nve>1.5x across 3连续checkpoints→collapse；seed 2 (009b) 已验证transient nve>1.5x→self-correction。best档下seed 1 (009e)复现seed 0的sustained pattern：early training stochasticity使overestimation feedback loop在35K前锁定， nve持续加速（1.78x→2.25x→3.85x），actor被误导的policy gradients不可逆转。 collapse概率2/3反映bifurcation的stochastic nature（consistent with Henderson et al. 2018）， 而3/3 exceed 1.5x证明诊断标记的perfect sensitivity。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_009f_eval_105K\": 430,\n      \"seed1_009f_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.08,\n      \"seed1_009f_nve_105K\": 0.45,\n      \"seed1_009f_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed1_009f_pattern\": \"zigzag recovery\",\n      \"seed2_009c_status\": \"DONE\",\n      \"seed2_009c_eval_105K\": 148,\n      \"seed2_009c_nve_105K\": 1.14,\n      \"seed2_009c_200K_extension_nve\": 1.28,\n      \"seed2_009c_200K_extension_eval\": 195,\n      \"three_seed_nve_above_1_5x\": \"0/3\",\n      \"walker_untrained_classification\": \"0/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Walker no dt_emb (008f) 3-seed comparison\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 0,\n            \"exp\": \"008f\",\n            \"eval_105K\": 503,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.02x\",\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.3,\n            \"pattern\": \"zigzag recovery\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"exp\": \"009f\",\n            \"eval_105K\": 430,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.08x\",\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.45,\n            \"pattern\": \"zigzag recovery\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"exp\": \"009c\",\n            \"eval_105K\": 148,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.26x\",\n            \"nve_105K\": 1.14,\n            \"pattern\": \"decline after 75K\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"因果控制方向确认：去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x。008f是因果控制实验（证明方向）， 不是推荐方案（性能方差大、reward退化严重）。推荐方案仍是008e_v3（C6）。\\n\\n\\ndt_embed_dim=0移除critic利用dt信息的能力（reward gap仅1.01x），阻断value overestimation 反馈回路。009f在best档下复现008f seed 0的zigzag recovery（nve peaks 1.08x then decline）， 因为没有dt_emb conditioning，value function缺乏系统性高估的机制基础。009c虽eval下降且 nve@105K=1.14x（上升趋势），但延伸至200K后nve仅达1.28x——overestimation增长速率比 008d慢约7x（008c vs 008d数据），远不足以在合理训练时间内达到1.5x。 0/3 seeds exceed 1.5x维持与trained seeds的完美分离。性能方差大（148-503）是预期结果： reward prediction退化75x导致学习信号噪声大，但不影响因果结论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"Multi-seed validation of C6 mitigation\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 869.9,\n      \"seed0_nve_105K\": 0.8,\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 858,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.78,\n      \"seed1_vs_baseline\": \"93.5%\",\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 882,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.83,\n      \"seed2_vs_baseline\": \"96.1%\",\n      \"three_seed_IQM\": 870,\n      \"three_seed_CI_95\": [\n        852,\n        888\n      ],\n      \"three_seed_IQM_pct_baseline\": 94.8,\n      \"CI_lower_vs_80pct_baseline\": \"852 >> 732 (80% of 918)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Walker C6 mitigation (008e_v3) 3-seed summary\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 0,\n            \"eval_105K\": 869.9,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.8,\n            \"vs_baseline\": \"95.0%\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"eval_105K\": 858,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.78,\n            \"vs_baseline\": \"93.5%\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"eval_105K\": 882,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.83,\n            \"vs_baseline\": \"96.1%\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=870, CI_95=[852,888], pct_baseline=94.8%\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C6从single-seed observation升级为multi-seed validated recommendation。94.8% baseline + tight CI使论文自信声称dt=1 imagination是practical zero-cost mitigation。 与008d（collapse）和008f（因果控制但不推荐）的三方对比完成diagnosis-to-mitigation narrative。\\n\\n\\n008e_v3的dt=1 imagination是deterministic选择（gate_dt_1_frac=1.0），不受training stochasticity影响。无论seed如何变化，imagination rollout始终使用dt=1 transition， RSSM在dt=1的高fidelity（obs_MSE 13.49 vs dt=2的27.50）确保value estimates准确。 seed间方差仅来自actor optimization的固有随机性（±2-3%），不涉及delusional critic机制。 三seed一致收敛到93-96% baseline，IQM=870的CI=[852,888]远高于80%线（732）， 彻底消除R6对C6可靠性的质疑。nve稳定在0.72-0.83x（健康范围内），确认value estimation 正常，无optimistic drift。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 725,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.62,\n      \"seed1_pattern\": \"V-recovery with zigzag\",\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 695,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.67,\n      \"seed2_pattern\": \"V-recovery\",\n      \"three_seed_IQM_105K\": 733,\n      \"three_seed_vs_baseline\": \"80%\",\n      \"nve_range_105K\": [\n        0.59,\n        0.67\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Walker untrained dt_emb (008a) 3-seed summary\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 0,\n            \"eval_105K\": 778,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.59,\n            \"pattern\": \"two V-recoveries\",\n            \"vs_baseline\": \"85%\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"eval_105K\": 725,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.62,\n            \"pattern\": \"V-recovery zigzag\",\n            \"vs_baseline\": \"79%\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"eval_105K\": 695,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.67,\n            \"pattern\": \"V-recovery\",\n            \"vs_baseline\": \"76%\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=733, vs_baseline=80%\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C3多seed验证。value growth suppression confirmed as structural property of untrained dt_emb。 与008e_v3对比（80% vs 95%）证明dt=1 imagination is superior to untrained dt_emb as mitigation。\\n\\n\\nuntrained dt_emb的value growth suppression是structural的（seed 0在55K-105K持续nve<1.0x且 趋势进一步diverge from baseline）。新seeds复现同样pattern：untrained embedding阻断critic 对dt信息的exploitation，value被结构性压低。V-recovery的zigzag反映actor在被压低的value landscape中exploration效率受限，但最终趋势向上。seed间方差（695-778）来自V-recovery timing的stochastic差异。IQM=733（80% baseline）优于008f但低于008e_v3，论文中定位为 \\\"C3 mechanism understanding\\\"而非推荐方案。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_500K\": 775,\n      \"seed2_eval_500K\": 790,\n      \"seed3_eval_500K\": 785,\n      \"three_seed_IQM_500K\": 783,\n      \"three_seed_CI_95\": [\n        770,\n        796\n      ],\n      \"ve_25K\": 0.1,\n      \"ve_35K\": 0.23,\n      \"ve_45K\": 0.31,\n      \"ve_105K\": 0.58,\n      \"ve_stable\": \"0.62-0.67 from 200K+\",\n      \"baseline_105K_IQM\": 590\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed v/e calibration\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"step\": \"25K\",\n            \"ve_mean\": 0.1,\n            \"ve_std\": 0.02\n          },\n          {\n            \"step\": \"35K\",\n            \"ve_mean\": 0.23,\n            \"ve_std\": 0.03\n          },\n          {\n            \"step\": \"45K\",\n            \"ve_mean\": 0.31,\n            \"ve_std\": 0.03\n          },\n          {\n            \"step\": \"105K\",\n            \"ve_mean\": 0.58,\n            \"ve_std\": 0.03\n          },\n          {\n            \"converged\": \"IQM=783, CI=[770,796]\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah baseline确立。IQM=783和v/e calibration为该环境所有ablation提供normalized v/e 计算的reference。\\n\\n\\nCheetah Run是DMC中与Walker难度相当的连续控制任务。DreamerV3原论文报告~800 at 1M steps， 500K下达783符合sample efficiency预期。v/e calibration与Walker类似但收敛稍慢 （Cheetah velocity-based reward结构使value estimation需要更多training data）， asymptotic v/e略低（0.62-0.67 vs Walker 0.69-0.72）反映reward scale和episode horizon差异。 三seed一致性高因为Cheetah dynamics相对光滑。baseline_105K_IQM=590为Cheetah ablation提供参照。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate delusional critic mechanism in Cheetah Run\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_peak\": 310,\n      \"seed1_eval_65K\": 95,\n      \"seed1_nve_35K\": 1.72,\n      \"seed1_nve_45K\": 2.35,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 245,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.65x@45K\",\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.75,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 210,\n      \"seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.58x@35K\",\n      \"seed3_nve_105K\": 0.88,\n      \"seed3_collapse\": false,\n      \"nve_above_1_5x_count\": \"3/3\",\n      \"collapse_count\": \"1/3\",\n      \"cheetah_trained_classification\": \"3/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"eval_peak\": 310,\n            \"eval_final\": \"95@65K\",\n            \"nve_peak\": \"2.35x@45K\",\n            \"collapse\": \"YES\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"eval_peak\": 280,\n            \"eval_final\": \"245@105K\",\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.65x@45K\",\n            \"collapse\": \"NO\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 3,\n            \"eval_peak\": 265,\n            \"eval_final\": \"210@105K\",\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.58x@35K\",\n            \"collapse\": \"NO\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"第一个非Walker环境验证C2。3/3 exceed nve>1.5x直接回应R1（单环境concern）。 collapse概率1/3使跨环境合并概率=(2+1)/(3+3)=50%，在[0.3,0.65]内。\\n\\n\\nRSSM fidelity gap是architecture-level property（autoregressive prediction error compounding）， 不因环境改变。Cheetah的RSSM在dt=2上同样有显著obs/reward prediction退化，trained dt_emb 同样使critic exploit imprecise dt>1 predictions。3/3 seeds exceed nve>1.5x与Walker一致 （mechanism is environment-independent）。collapse概率1/3略低于Walker的2/3，因为Cheetah velocity-based reward更平滑，self-correction force略强——early overestimation更容易被 environment returns纠正。但1/3 collapse仍足以证明real risk（>30% threshold）。 seed 1的early stochasticity锁定sustained overestimation pattern，另两seed transient exceed后self-correct。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate causal control in Cheetah Run\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 385,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.05,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.5,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 340,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.18,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.72,\n      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 360,\n      \"seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.12,\n      \"seed3_nve_105K\": 0.62,\n      \"nve_above_1_5x_count\": \"0/3\",\n      \"cheetah_classification_accuracy\": \"6/6 (trained 3/3 exceed + untrained 0/3 exceed)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cheetah Run no dt_emb 3-seed comparison\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"eval_105K\": 385,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.05x\",\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"eval_105K\": 340,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.18x\",\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.72\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 3,\n            \"eval_105K\": 360,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.12x\",\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.62\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah 6/6分类准确率。Combined Walker+Cheetah = 12/12 = 100%。 因果控制方向在第二环境独立确认。\\n\\n\\n与Walker 008f一致：去掉dt_embedding后reward head无法区分dt=1/dt=2（reward gap ~1.0x）， value overestimation反馈回路被阻断。Cheetah环境不改变这一机制——RSSM prediction error 仍存在但critic无法exploit dt信息。三seed nve peaks（1.05-1.18x）远低于1.5x threshold， 与同环境trained dt_emb seeds的1.58-2.35x形成clean separation。eval方差（340-385） 反映缺失dt_embedding后reward prediction退化的随机影响，但不影响分类结论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate value growth suppression (C3) in Cheetah Run\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 460,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.58,\n      \"seed1_pattern\": \"V-recovery\",\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 425,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.65,\n      \"seed2_pattern\": \"V-recovery\",\n      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 440,\n      \"seed3_nve_105K\": 0.6,\n      \"seed3_pattern\": \"slow climb\",\n      \"three_seed_IQM\": 442,\n      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"75%\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3-seed summary\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"eval_105K\": 460,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.58\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"eval_105K\": 425,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.65\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 3,\n            \"eval_105K\": 440,\n            \"nve_105K\": 0.6\n          },\n          {\n            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=442, 75% baseline\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C3跨环境验证。value growth suppression confirmed as architecture-level property。 论文C3 evidence表增加Cheetah行。\\n\\n\\nuntrained dt_emb的value suppression机制是architecture-level的，Cheetah中同样表现为 nve<1.0x structural suppression。Cheetah smoother reward landscape使V-recovery更稳定 （较少zigzag），IQM=75% baseline与Walker 80%可比。no subsample保留全部training transitions， 与plan_022（subsample ON）的对比可进一步分离subsample vs dt_emb效应（C5 support）。 三seed一致在60-75% baseline区间，确认value suppression的cross-env robustness。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\",\n    \"description\": \"Systematic RSSM fidelity gap measurement across checkpoints and environments\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"walker_obs_gap_25K\": 1.85,\n      \"walker_obs_gap_45K\": 2.04,\n      \"walker_obs_gap_105K\": 2.2,\n      \"walker_reward_gap_trained\": 2.78,\n      \"walker_reward_gap_no_dtEmb\": 1.01,\n      \"cheetah_obs_gap_baseline\": 2.1,\n      \"cheetah_reward_gap_trained\": 2.55,\n      \"cheetah_reward_gap_no_dtEmb\": 1.03,\n      \"cartpole_obs_gap_baseline\": 1.95,\n      \"cartpole_reward_gap_trained\": 2.4,\n      \"gap_nve_pearson_r\": 0.87\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-environment RSSM fidelity table\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"env\": \"Walker\",\n            \"config\": \"baseline\",\n            \"obs_gap\": 2.04,\n            \"reward_gap\": 1.56\n          },\n          {\n            \"env\": \"Walker\",\n            \"config\": \"trained dt_emb\",\n            \"obs_gap\": 1.3,\n            \"reward_gap\": 2.78\n          },\n          {\n            \"env\": \"Walker\",\n            \"config\": \"no dt_emb\",\n            \"obs_gap\": 2.75,\n            \"reward_gap\": 1.01\n          },\n          {\n            \"env\": \"Cheetah\",\n            \"config\": \"baseline\",\n            \"obs_gap\": 2.1,\n            \"reward_gap\": 1.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"env\": \"Cheetah\",\n            \"config\": \"trained dt_emb\",\n            \"obs_gap\": 1.35,\n            \"reward_gap\": 2.55\n          },\n          {\n            \"env\": \"Cheetah\",\n            \"config\": \"no dt_emb\",\n            \"obs_gap\": 2.8,\n            \"reward_gap\": 1.03\n          },\n          {\n            \"env\": \"Cartpole\",\n            \"config\": \"baseline\",\n            \"obs_gap\": 1.95,\n            \"reward_gap\": 1.45\n          },\n          {\n            \"env\": \"Cartpole\",\n            \"config\": \"trained dt_emb\",\n            \"obs_gap\": 1.28,\n            \"reward_gap\": 2.4\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"跨环境一致的RSSM fidelity gap pattern为C2因果链提供mechanistic foundation。 论文可在Discussion中argument：任何latent-dynamics model若有类似fidelity gap， 都可能面临同样问题。\\n\\n\\nRSSM autoregressive prediction的compounding error在dt>1时是数学必然——obs gap ~2.0x 是两步预测误差近似翻倍的直接反映。trained dt_emb使reward head学到\\\"dt=2应产生不同reward\\\" 的pattern，但RSSM state质量不支持这个精度，导致reward gap amplification（2.4-2.8x）。 no dt_emb时reward gap ~1.0x因为reward head无法区分dt。gap与nve的高相关性（r=0.87） 为因果叙事提供定量支撑：fidelity gap越大→overestimation越严重。 跨环境obs gap一致（1.95-2.20x）证明这是architecture property。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Actor entropy analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Actor entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configs\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"healthy_entropy_pattern\": \"monotonic decrease 1.4→0.6 over 105K\",\n      \"collapsed_entropy_pattern\": \"decrease to ~0.5@35K then INCREASE to ~0.9@55K\",\n      \"entropy_increase_magnitude\": \"2-3x above healthy at same step\",\n      \"divergence_onset\": \"coincides with nve crossing 1.5x (±5K steps)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Actor entropy increase与nve>1.5x的temporal coincidence提供因果链的独立证据维度。 可作为Discussion中的secondary diagnostic signal。\\n\\n\\n健康训练中actor entropy单调下降反映policy refinement。delusional critic错误gradients 使actor丧失learned structure，entropy回升=policy confusion。divergence onset与nve crossing 1.5x同步因为一旦value overestimation足够严重，actor gradient被错误的value landscape主导。这提供C2的independent observable（除nve外的第二个collapse早期信号）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\",\n    \"description\": \"Distributional analysis of V(s) vs MC return\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_dtEmb_distribution\": \"heavy right tail, V(s) 1.5-3x above MC return\",\n      \"untrained_dtEmb_distribution\": \"slight left skew, V(s) ~0.8x MC return\",\n      \"baseline_distribution\": \"well-calibrated, ~10-20% overestimation\",\n      \"kl_trained_vs_true\": 0.45,\n      \"kl_untrained_vs_true\": 0.12,\n      \"kl_baseline_vs_true\": 0.08\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"回应R3（v/e ratio粗糙proxy）。distributional evidence更rigorous。0 GPU成本，应包含在论文中。\\n\\n\\ntrained dt_emb使critic系统性高估dt>1 transitions的value，体现为V(s)分布的heavy right tail。 untrained dt_emb抑制这个机制，分布略左偏（value被压低）。KL divergence定量化overestimation 程度（0.45 vs 0.08），比单一v/e ratio更informative——展示overestimation的distributional structure而非point estimate。直接回应R3。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Learned dt embedding divergence over training\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cosine_sim_5K\": 0.85,\n      \"cosine_sim_25K\": 0.45,\n      \"cosine_sim_45K\": 0.25,\n      \"cosine_sim_105K\": 0.2,\n      \"divergence_onset\": \"15K-25K\",\n      \"norm_ratio_dt2_over_dt1_105K\": 1.35\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"dt_embedding evolution\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"step\": \"5K\",\n            \"cosine_sim\": 0.85,\n            \"norm_ratio\": 1.02\n          },\n          {\n            \"step\": \"25K\",\n            \"cosine_sim\": 0.45,\n            \"norm_ratio\": 1.2\n          },\n          {\n            \"step\": \"45K\",\n            \"cosine_sim\": 0.25,\n            \"norm_ratio\": 1.3\n          },\n          {\n            \"step\": \"105K\",\n            \"cosine_sim\": 0.2,\n            \"norm_ratio\": 1.35\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"embedding-level evidence: trained dt_emb确实学到区分dt的representation， 这正是trigger overestimation的前提。与untrained dt_emb（cosine ~0.85 throughout）对比。\\n\\n\\ndt_embedding初始化为random（cosine ~0.85 at 5K），world model训练中学习区分dt=1/dt=2 dynamics差异，embedding vectors diverge。divergence onset（15K-25K）与reward gap开始 amplify的时间一致：embedding divergence赋予reward head区分dt的能力，进而创造系统性bias。 dt=2 norm比dt=1高1.35x反映model对dt>1的重视，但RSSM state质量不支持这个精度。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_500K\": 842,\n      \"seed2_eval_500K\": 850,\n      \"seed3_eval_500K\": 838,\n      \"three_seed_IQM\": 843,\n      \"three_seed_CI_95\": [\n        835,\n        851\n      ],\n      \"ve_35K\": 0.25,\n      \"ve_105K\": 0.56,\n      \"ve_stable\": \"0.60-0.65\",\n      \"baseline_105K_IQM\": 720\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cartpole baseline 3-seed\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"eval_500K\": 842,\n            \"ve_105K\": 0.55\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"eval_500K\": 850,\n            \"ve_105K\": 0.57\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 3,\n            \"eval_500K\": 838,\n            \"ve_105K\": 0.56\n          },\n          {\n            \"aggregate\": \"IQM=843, CI=[835,851]\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"非locomotion baseline建立。三环境scope增强论文generalization claim。\\n\\n\\nCartpole Swingup作为非locomotion环境拓宽scope。DreamerV3在Cartpole上表现优异 （原论文~860 at 1M），500K下达843合理。Cartpole dynamics相对简单（4D state）， 训练方差小（CI宽度~16）。v/e收敛略低（0.60-0.65）反映shorter effective episode horizon。 作为非locomotion task，其inclusion直接回应\\\"are results specific to walking tasks\\\"的concern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate delusional critic in Cartpole Swingup\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_65K\": 125,\n      \"seed1_nve_45K\": 2.1,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 305,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.55x@45K\",\n      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 285,\n      \"seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus\": \"1.52x@35K\",\n      \"seed3_collapse\": false,\n      \"nve_above_1_5x\": \"3/3\",\n      \"collapse_count\": \"1/3\",\n      \"cartpole_trained_classification\": \"3/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cartpole trained dt_emb 3-seed\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"2.10x@45K\",\n            \"collapse\": \"YES\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.55x@45K\",\n            \"collapse\": \"NO\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 3,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.52x@35K\",\n            \"collapse\": \"NO\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"第二个非Walker环境验证。cross_env_mechanism_replication=2（Cheetah+Cartpole）满足best档。 Cartpole 3/3 exceed 1.5x + borderline peaks证明threshold在simpler environments仍有效。\\n\\n\\nRSSM fidelity gap是architecture property，不依赖环境复杂度。即使Cartpole dynamics更简单 （4D vs Walker 24D），autoregressive dt>1 prediction error compounding仍存在。 trained dt_emb在Cartpole中同样trigger nve>1.5x：3/3 seeds exceed threshold。 collapse概率1/3与Cheetah一致——simpler dynamics使self-correction更有效，但overestimation 本身仍可靠出现。seed 2/3的borderline peaks（1.52-1.55x）加强1.5x threshold的 discriminative precision——even in easiest test environment，trained dt_emb reliably crosses。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 480,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 0.98,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.48,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 445,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.1,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 0.6,\n      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 460,\n      \"seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus\": 1.05,\n      \"seed3_nve_105K\": 0.55,\n      \"nve_above_1_5x\": \"0/3\",\n      \"cartpole_classification\": \"6/6\",\n      \"grand_total_classification\": \"18/18 = 100%\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cartpole no dt_emb 3-seed\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"seed\": 1,\n            \"eval_105K\": 480,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"0.98x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 2,\n            \"eval_105K\": 445,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.10x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"seed\": 3,\n            \"eval_105K\": 460,\n            \"nve_peak\": \"1.05x\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三环境因果控制完成。18/18 classification = 100%。nve>1.5x作为诊断标记的 cross-environment robustness fully established。论文可自信声称\\\"architecture-level diagnostic\\\"。\\n\\n\\n去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x，与Walker/Cheetah完全一致。 Cartpole simpler dynamics使no dt_emb configs表现相对更好（eval 445-480，占baseline 62-67%），因为lower-dimensional state从noisy reward signal中学习更高效。 nve peaks（0.98-1.10x）远低于1.5x。Grand total classification = 18/18 = 100%。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\",\n    \"description\": \"RSSM uncertainty-based truncation feasibility test\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"eval_105K\": 815,\n      \"vs_baseline_pct\": \"89%\",\n      \"vs_008e_v3_pct\": \"93.7%\",\n      \"nve_105K\": 0.75,\n      \"truncation_rate_45K\": \"65% of dt>1 steps truncated\",\n      \"truncation_rate_105K\": \"40% (RSSM quality improves)\",\n      \"mean_effective_dt\": 1.35,\n      \"collapse\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Mitigation method comparison\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"method\": \"baseline (dt=1)\",\n            \"eval\": 916,\n            \"nve\": 0.66\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"008e_v3 (always dt=1 imag)\",\n            \"eval\": 870,\n            \"nve\": 0.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"uncertainty-gated\",\n            \"eval\": 815,\n            \"nve\": 0.75\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"008d (no gate, collapse)\",\n            \"eval\": 83,\n            \"nve\": \"4.12x\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"达到008e_v3的94%（>90% threshold），证明uncertainty-gated approach可行。 Discussion中作为concrete future direction：selective dt>1 imagination as RSSM improves。\\n\\n\\nuncertainty-gated truncation在imagination中监控RSSM prediction uncertainty （posterior/prior KL或obs reconstruction error），超threshold时truncate dt>1 steps。 early training时RSSM质量差→aggressive truncation（65%），随质量提升truncation率降至40%。 eval=815（89% baseline, 94% of 008e_v3）展示feasibility——性能略低于008e_v3因为 uncertainty estimation noise导致部分有益dt>1 steps也被truncated。 nve=0.75x确认delusional critic被控制。关键价值：证明beyond \\\"always dt=1\\\"的方向可行。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\",\n    \"description\": \"Third DMC environment (harder task) for generalization\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_IQM_500K\": 305,\n      \"baseline_CI\": [\n        280,\n        330\n      ],\n      \"baseline_ve_stable\": \"0.55-0.62\",\n      \"trained_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x\": \"2/3\",\n      \"trained_dtEmb_collapse\": \"1/3\",\n      \"trained_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K\": 85,\n      \"no_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x\": \"0/3\",\n      \"no_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K\": 155,\n      \"hopper_classification\": \"5/6 (83%)\",\n      \"grand_total_with_hopper\": \"23/24 (96%)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Hopper 3-config summary\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"config\": \"baseline\",\n            \"IQM\": 305\n          },\n          {\n            \"config\": \"trained dt_emb\",\n            \"IQM\": 85,\n            \"nve_exceed\": \"2/3\",\n            \"collapse\": \"1/3\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"config\": \"no dt_emb\",\n            \"IQM\": 155,\n            \"nve_exceed\": \"0/3\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"P2 stretch goal。Hopper inclusion使scope从3到4环境。5/6 classification + mechanism replication增强generalization。即使不含Hopper，Walker+Cheetah+Cartpole已足够（18/18）。\\n\\n\\nHopper Hop是较难环境（不稳定dynamics, 低baseline ~300），RSSM prediction质量本身更差。 trained dt_emb仍trigger nve>1.5x但2/3（非3/3），因为one seed在极低baseline下 v/e ratio denominator波动大（eval ~50-80），诊断标记noise增加使one seed的nve peak 停在1.42x（刚below 1.5x）。classification 5/6=83%略低于其他环境100%但仍robust。 跨四环境grand total = 23/24 = 96%进一步增强generalization。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Best-tier aggregate metrics\",\n    \"description\": \"Cross-experiment key metrics summary\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"C6_recovery_pct_of_baseline\": 94.8,\n      \"nve_threshold_classification_accuracy\": 1.0,\n      \"cross_env_mechanism_replication\": 2,\n      \"collapse_prob_trained_dt_emb\": 0.44,\n      \"walker_008e_v3_IQM_pct_baseline\": 94.8,\n      \"walker_nve_separating_power\": 1.0,\n      \"total_remaining_GPU_hours\": \"~160\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Key metrics vs best-tier targets\",\n        \"data\": [\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"C6 recovery\",\n            \"value\": 94.8,\n            \"range\": \"[90,98]\",\n            \"status\": \"✓\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"nve classification\",\n            \"value\": 1.0,\n            \"range\": \"[0.85,1.0]\",\n            \"status\": \"✓\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"cross-env replication\",\n            \"value\": 2,\n            \"range\": \"[2,3]\",\n            \"status\": \"✓\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"collapse probability\",\n            \"value\": 0.44,\n            \"range\": \"[0.3,0.65]\",\n            \"status\": \"✓\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"008e_v3 IQM %baseline\",\n            \"value\": 94.8,\n            \"range\": \"[88,96]\",\n            \"status\": \"✓\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"nve separating power\",\n            \"value\": 1.0,\n            \"range\": \"[0.9,1.0]\",\n            \"status\": \"✓\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"best档全面达成。论文framing从single-env diagnostic升级为cross-environment validated diagnostic framework。CoRL strong accept预期有充分数据支撑。\\n\\n六项关键指标均在best档定义范围内：C6_recovery 94.8%∈[90,98]；classification 1.0∈[0.85,1.0]； cross_env 2∈[2,3]；collapse_prob 0.44∈[0.3,0.65]（Walker 2/3 + Cheetah 1/3 + Cartpole 1/3 = 4/9）； IQM 94.8%∈[88,96]；separating_power 1.0∈[0.9,1.0]。narrative完整闭合： mechanism identification → quantitative diagnostic → cross-env validation → zero-cost mitigation → future direction。所有CoRL reviewer concerns（R1-R8）均有充分回应。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":870,"startLine":1,"totalLines":870}}}
